      <h3>Conformance status</h3>
      <p>
        eiss-europa.com is <strong>partially conformant</strong> with RGAA&nbsp;{{ rgaaAudit.version }}.
      </p>
      <p>
        An internal audit on <strong>9 October 2026</strong> found <strong>{{ rgaaAudit.rate }}&nbsp;% of the
        applicable criteria met</strong> on the pages listed below: {{ rgaaAudit.conformant }} criteria
        conformant, {{ rgaaAudit.notApplicable }} not applicable, none non-conformant. The tests that call
        for a screen reader were judged from the browser's accessibility tree and have not yet been repeated
        with NVDA and VoiceOver. The status will read fully conformant once they have
        (<a href="{{ rgaaAudit.pendingIssue }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">tracked in public</a>).
      </p>

      <h3>Content that is not accessible</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Non-conformities:</strong> none found on the audited pages. The limitations in §3 still apply.</li>
        <li><strong>Exemptions for disproportionate burden:</strong> none claimed.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Content outside the scope of this declaration:</strong> services on other platforms that
          the site links to, namely the conference platform at indico.eiss-europa.com, Stripe for payments,
          Mailchimp for the newsletter and YouTube. The programme PDFs of past editions sit beside an HTML
          programme on each edition's page, which is their accessible version.
        </li>
      </ul>

